{"word":"ἡμερόω-ῶ","uri":"hêmeroô-ô","senses":[{"word":"ἡμερόω-ῶ","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἡμερόω-ῶ,</span></span> adoucir une nature sauvage,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> <span class=\"ital\">en\nparl. d’animaux,</span> apprivoiser, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">493</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>; <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">H.A.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 1, 28 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Geop.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">16, 21, 2</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">en\nparl. d’un pays,</span> purger de bêtes sauvages, de brigands,\nrendre habitable, <span class=\"aut\">Pd.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">I.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 98 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Eum.</span> <span class=\"refch\">14 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> cultiver,\n<span class=\"aut\">Th.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">C.P.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">5, 15, 6</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> <span class=\"ital\">en\nparl. d’hommes,</span> civiliser, adoucir, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">937</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span>, <span class=\"refch\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> conquérir par la\ndouceur, subjuguer, <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 5</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"sect\"><span class=\"secta\">Moy.</span> se concilier,\nsubjuguer, <span class=\"ital\">acc.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 2</span>.</div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἥμερος</span>.</div>\n"}]}